<title>USA: Chase Manhattan Q1 operating net $946 mln.</title>
<headline>Chase Manhattan Q1 operating net $946 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary     $2.01		    $1.81</p>
<p> Shr diluted     2.02		     1.82</p>
<p> Net profit	927,000	  loss  89,000</p>
<p> Revs		4,150,000		4,035,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Share results for both quarters exclude restructuring charges, reflecting the merger with Chemical Bank.</p>
<p>Operating income for the quarter ended March 31 was $946 million, versus $867 million in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Net results for both periods include merger-related restructuring costs, included a charge of $1,026 million, net of taxes, and special items totaling $70 million, net of taxes in 1996.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Chase Manhattan Corp.</p>
</text>
